>>> If we had the capability in Kafka Stream to join KStream with KTable on
>>> foreign key this would simplify our implementation significantly.
>>>
>>> Looking forward to your feedback and discussion.
>>>
>>> Regards,
>>>
>>> Igor
>>>
>>
