Hi All,

I added a remark about the repartition of null-key records.
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-962%3A+Relax+non-null=
+key+requirement+in+Kafka+Streams#KIP962:RelaxnonnullkeyrequirementinKafkaS=
treams-Repartitionofnull-keyrecords

Can we relax this constraint for any kind of repartitioning or should it
only be relaxed in the context of left stream-table and left/outer
stream-stream joins?

Florin

