In the current implementation of the KafkaConsumer, the ConsumerCoordinator=
 commits offsets before the consumer is closed, with a call to=C2=A0
maybeAutoCommitOffsetsSync(timer);
The async consumer should provide the same behaviour to commit offsets on c=
lose.=C2=A0



